00:32:16,800 --> 00:32:21,800
and also rewarding growth experiences have risks

722
00:32:22,600 --> 00:32:25,800
and we can't eliminate all of those risks.

723
00:32:25,800 --> 00:32:30,800
But at the other side of it is my advocacy for risk

724
00:32:31,040 --> 00:32:33,760
doesn't mean that it's an excuse

