00:35:50,640 --> 00:35:53,200
including a lot of common high school sports

794
00:35:53,200 --> 00:35:55,600
are much more hazardous than the type

795
00:35:55,600 --> 00:35:58,000
of outdoor activities we're talking about.

796
00:35:58,880 --> 00:35:59,720
but at the end of the day,

